<title>THAILAND: Krung Thai Bank postpones China branch opening.</title>
<headline>Krung Thai Bank postpones China branch opening.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's state-run Krung Thai Bank on Thursday said it had postponed the opening of its Kunming branch following the death of China's supreme leader Deng Xiaoping.</p>
</text>
